# API DESIGN & INTEGRATION STANDARDS
RESTful design principles and integration requirements for DABS system

## FASTAPI IMPLEMENTATION STANDARDS
### Required FastAPI Configuration
MANDATORY FastAPI setup pattern:
```python
from fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException, Depends, status
from fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware
from fastapi.security import HTTPBearer

app = FastAPI(
    title="DABS Automation API",
    description="Utah Package Agency Liquor Inventory Management System",
    version="1.0.0",
    docs_url="/api/docs",
    redoc_url="/api/redoc"
)
```

## RESTFUL DESIGN PRINCIPLES
### Resource Naming Conventions
MANDATORY resource naming standards:
```python
# ✅ CORRECT - Resource-based URLs
GET /api/v1/products                    # List products
GET /api/v1/products/{sku}             # Get specific product
POST /api/v1/products                   # Create new product
PUT /api/v1/products/{sku}             # Update product

# ❌ WRONG - Verb-based URLs
GET /api/v1/getProducts                # Don't use verbs
```

### Request/Response Models
ENFORCE Pydantic models for ALL endpoints:
```python
from pydantic import BaseModel, Field, validator
from decimal import Decimal

class DABSProductRequest(BaseModel):
    sku: str = Field(..., regex=r'^[A-Z0-9]{6,12}$')
    product_name: str = Field(..., min_length=1, max_length=100)
    retail_price: Decimal = Field(..., gt=0, le=10000, decimal_places=2)
    category: str = Field(..., min_length=1, max_length=50)
```

## EXTERNAL API INTEGRATION STANDARDS
### QuickBooks Integration Performance
MANDATORY QuickBooks integration with rate limiting:
```python
class QuickBooksClient:
    async def sync_inventory(self, products: List[DABSProduct]):
        """MANDATORY: Respect 500 requests/minute rate limit"""
        rate_limiter = AsyncRateLimiter(max_calls=500, time_window=60)
        
        for product in products:
            async with rate_limiter:
                await self._update_qb_item(product)
```

### SSCS Integration with Fallback
MANDATORY SSCS integration pattern:
```python
class SSCSIntegrator:
    async def update_prices(self, products: List[DABSProduct]) -> bool:
        """Primary API method with file fallback"""
        try:
            if self.api_client.is_available():
                return await self._api_update(products)
        except SSCSAPIException:
            # Fallback to file-based integration
            return await self._file_update(products)
```

## VIOLATION PREVENTION
❌ NEVER skip Pydantic model validation for requests/responses
❌ NEVER hardcode external API URLs or credentials
❌ NEVER skip rate limiting for external API calls
❌ NEVER use synchronous code for external API calls

